Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:12.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若邪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:14.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抓個堅實可靠的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.61,0:00:21.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是讓你抓三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:25.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:31.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:32.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:33.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別又飛走了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,謝謝三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:34.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,收
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:36.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥還會此等法術
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:37.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神奇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:38.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:39.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要慌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:47.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:48.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這樣比較安全
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:50.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你暫時忍一忍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:52.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:53.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要再抓人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:00:57.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,離我遠點兒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:00:58.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,噁心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:00:59.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,滾開
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.23,0:01:01.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼你們也上來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.15,0:01:03.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,問你這條傻白綾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.74,0:01:06.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說了別抓人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.87,0:01:08.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神官也算人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:18.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們也暫時忍一忍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.67,0:01:19.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若邪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.55,0:01:20.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千萬別再抓錯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:22.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.05,0:01:24.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別指望這玩意兒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.26,0:01:25.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想點兒別的辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:33.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.64,0:01:34.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再給它一次機會
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.89,0:01:36.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放過路人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.94,0:01:37.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這次穩了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.77,0:01:38.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那頭重得很
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.61,0:01:40.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,收
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.26,0:02:10.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這可真是天官賜福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:13.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快 進去避避
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:26.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天殺的那兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.35,0:04:27.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要是被我抓到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:28.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.89,0:04:29.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,絕對什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:30.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再吞幾斤沙子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:32.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:41.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:43.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你在想什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:46.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那二人步伐輕盈奇異
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:47.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,絕非凡人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:51.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那白衣女子應該就是半月國師
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那黑衣女子又是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:54.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,難道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:58.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是妖道雙師中的芳心國師
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:04:59.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:01.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,芳心國師是永安國的國師
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:04.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,兩人出世時間相隔近百年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:07.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怎麼這麼清楚永安國的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:08.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:10.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,實不相瞞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我曾在永安國收過破爛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.35,0:05:15.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,總之
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:18.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若半月國師想要把我們攔在此處
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:19.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.07,0:05:21.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那咱們就在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:22.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等風沙過去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.99,0:05:23.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也只能這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:40.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對了 南風
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:41.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,剛剛風沙里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:43.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們怎麼不使個千斤墜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:44.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,使了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:45.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:47.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這裡是極西北
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.05,0:05:49.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,方圓數百里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:51.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,根本找不到一間玄真廟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:53.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我家將軍管東南
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.23,0:05:55.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他家將軍主西南
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:56.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出了範圍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:57.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,法力受限
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:01.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:02.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這岩石硬得緊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:05.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為何能挖出這樣一個洞來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:10.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南陽殿的人跟他主子一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:12.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,見到什麼都大驚小怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:20.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月人以放牧為生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:22.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,過夜時為避風沙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大多會在岩石上開鑿洞穴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:26.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有時
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:27.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,甚至會用上炸藥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:32.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:34.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誰在那
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:42.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:48.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我 我們是路過的普通商人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:50.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,外面風沙太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:51.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就在這兒避避風
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.49,0:06:54.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既是普通商人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:57.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為何鬼鬼祟祟躲藏於此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:06:58.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們好好避著風
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們忽然闖進來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:01.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,手上還憑空冒火
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:03.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誰知道你們是人是鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪敢出聲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:08.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,臭小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:11.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天生 別亂說話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:13.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鄭伯 我可沒亂說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:15.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明明他們才可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:22.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誤會誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:24.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在下是一間道觀的觀主
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.61,0:07:25.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這幾位
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:26.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是我觀內之人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:27.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們使的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:29.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,乃是奇門遁甲之術
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:32.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如此說來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:34.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們是普通商人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:36.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們是普通道人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:37.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為避風沙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:39.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恰好躲進同一個岩洞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:41.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:43.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既然大家都是普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:45.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此處每逢過關 失蹤過半
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:46.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,諸位竟還敢來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:48.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如何能說普通
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:52.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,傳聞多有誇大之處
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:53.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只要找對人帶路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:55.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不進入半月古國
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:57.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還是能平安往返的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:07:59.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:01.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們有本地人帶路
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:02.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,躲過了好多流沙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:04.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,剛才一起風
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.15,0:08:05.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他就帶我們躲進來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:07.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對吧 阿昭哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:10.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,職責所在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:12.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,希望這風過了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:13.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,駱駝和貨也都沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:15.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一定沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:18.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以 道長您看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:19.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既是一場誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:20.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,方才多有得罪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.91,0:08:21.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:52.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:54.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:57.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你坐的這塊石頭上好像有字
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:08:57.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:11.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:12.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月文
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:15.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你會看半月文
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:17.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,實不相瞞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月妖道出世之前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.31,0:09:20.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也在半月國收過破爛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就好奇還有哪兒你沒去收過破爛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:27.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別理他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:28.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,石碑上說了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:35.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:36.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:38.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這石碑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:39.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是塊將軍冢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:41.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.49,0:09:42.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你也會半月文
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,興趣使然 認識幾個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:46.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好極了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:48.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你再過來些
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:48.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們一起看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:02.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:05.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這上面講了一位將軍的生平
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:07.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月國的將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:11.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是位中原的將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:14.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月和中原戰事不斷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:16.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,為何會為中原將軍立冢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:19.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,因為此人很是奇特
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.99,0:10:22.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,石碑上雖稱他為將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他卻只是一名校尉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:30.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,當年半月國和中原戰事激烈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:32.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他帶兵守在前線
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:36.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那他是後來打了勝仗才升了將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:38.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,並沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:39.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一開始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:40.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他統領百人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:43.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,後來 他統領七十人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:46.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再後來 他統領五十人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:47.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一路被貶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.90,0:10:50.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,官還能越做越低
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:51.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只要不犯錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:52.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就算不升
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.44,0:10:53.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不會降吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:56.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天底下真有這麼失敗的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:10:58.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這位小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:00.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,世界之大 無奇不有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:02.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:05.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這校尉之所以屢次被貶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:08.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只因他在戰場上多番礙事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:08.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼叫礙事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:10.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阻攔對方殺害己方百姓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:12.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也阻攔己方這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,攔一次就降一級
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:17.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到最後
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.67,0:11:18.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就貶無可貶了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:21.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阻攔士兵殺害百姓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:22.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這是在救人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:23.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又有什麼錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:25.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊 又沒害人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對啊 有什麼錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:27.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嘁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:28.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,錯得離譜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:30.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在其位謀其職
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:32.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這人既是軍人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:34.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就該時刻牢記軍人的職責
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:36.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,戰場上傷亡在所難免
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.11,0:11:38.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他要兩邊兼顧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.61,0:11:40.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只會落得己方厭憎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.03,0:11:41.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敵方嘲笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:42.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到頭來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.99,0:11:43.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:45.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可他真的救了人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們還為他立碑了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:48.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有碑在此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:50.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,證明這校尉不還是死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:52.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有史記載
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:53.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月國不還是沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:55.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他做的事有用嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:11:58.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可是 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:11:59.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:01.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:04.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:05.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我說得對麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:08.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可是這個校尉明明在救人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:10.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說得挺對
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:12.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:14.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,死在自己人手上了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:15.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,倒沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:17.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上面說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:18.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有次兩方交戰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:20.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打著打著
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:21.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這人靴帶沒繫緊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:23.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自己踩著了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:24.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,摔了一跤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:25.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:27.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就被雙方殺紅了眼的士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:30.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,亂腳踩死 亂刀砍死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:37.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:41.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,很好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:43.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒有沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:45.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是這死法有點兒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.97,0:12:46.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.85,0:12:50.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這校尉雖在軍中口碑不佳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:52.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,卻也有人受其恩惠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:54.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們尊他為將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:56.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,立了這塊冢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:59.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,後來人們發現這石碑很是神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.49,0:13:02.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只要對它跪拜三次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:04.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便可在戈壁逢凶化吉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:05.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:08.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,石碑上有這句話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:23.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我編的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:25.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們笑夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:27.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拜拜也不為過
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:28.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,調皮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:29.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:31.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有蛇呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.93,0:13:33.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼會有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:40.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沙漠裡有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:42.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,豈非是常事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:43.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,當心它的尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:44.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.11,0:13:47.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這尾巴生得有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.37,0:13:49.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:51.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果然是蠍尾蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:54.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蠍尾蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月國的一種生物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:58.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,身似蛇 尾似蠍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:13:59.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有劇毒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:02.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那半月妖道能成為國師
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:05.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也歸功於她能操縱這種蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.09,0:14:08.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,操縱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.35,0:14:11.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蛇不只一條
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:12.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家快出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:16.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:16.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:18.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好多蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:20.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這裡也有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:29.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:45.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.67,0:14:47.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:48.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:49.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:49.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:05.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼拜了石碑 反倒遇險
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.19,0:15:05.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.03,0:15:07.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,越拜越倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:08.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟那破爛仙人一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:11.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:12.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鄭伯伯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:15.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鄭伯伯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:16.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:24.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好厲害的蛇毒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:29.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.55,0:15:33.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:35.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,伯伯不會死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中蠍尾蛇毒者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:39.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,兩個時辰內必死無疑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:41.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:45.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這是解藥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:47.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,臨時續命的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:48.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最多拖延十二個時辰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:55.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,豈不是要等死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:56.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的沒救了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:57.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有救
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:00.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有香草名叫善月草
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:01.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可解蠍尾蛇毒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:03.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭哥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:05.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有解藥你怎麼不早說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.96,0:16:07.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中毒的人有救
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:08.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別的人卻要死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:10.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他當然不好說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:11.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:12.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,善月草
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:14.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只長在半月古國境內
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.55,0:16:16.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,難怪總有人會冒死闖入半月國
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:17.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:19.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:20.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這可如何是好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:21.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:25.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蠍尾蛇毒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.11,0:16:27.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這就是半月國師的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.53,0:16:28.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靈文
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:29.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我有事問你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:31.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靈文
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.07,0:16:35.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們能進通靈陣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:36.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我進不了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.45,0:16:39.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.91,0:16:40.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:46.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,連通靈陣都被阻隔了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:48.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這到底
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:53.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:06.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:07.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家留心些
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:08.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說不定附近還有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.99,0:17:11.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道長 你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:12.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:16.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們別在意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.03,0:17:17.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒有那麼嚴重
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.67,0:17:32.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:33.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,忍一忍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:39.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不必
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:40.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蠍尾蛇毒厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:41.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你當心中毒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:51.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他本來不一定會被咬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:52.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你瞎抓什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:54.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,添亂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:56.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可萬一他真的受傷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:01.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好了 三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:02.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我真的不痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:10.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.13,0:18:11.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:15.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家也檢查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:16.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若身上有傷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:17.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,儘快扎住
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:28.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道長哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:30.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:30.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:31.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒事個鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.02,0:18:33.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你都中了蛇毒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:34.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最好趕緊回天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:36.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,回去一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.78,0:18:38.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼 你們要走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:39.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我們怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.95,0:18:40.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道長
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.45,0:18:41.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們可別丟下我們吶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如今通靈被阻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:47.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,確實有必要回去通報
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:49.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,救人要緊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.29,0:18:50.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別著急
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:52.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們這就進城去找善月草
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:54.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在十二個時辰之內
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把它帶給你們
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:56.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:18:57.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只不過
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:18:59.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們需要這位小兄弟來帶路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:02.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:04.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們要是沒了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:06.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,扶搖留下護你們周全
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:07.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:08.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:10.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只要阿昭肯走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:11.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:13.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其實半月古城很好找
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.23,0:19:15.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,順著這個方向下去就能到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:21.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:22.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靠你了 阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:23.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊 拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:24.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我們就出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:54.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你懷疑這個阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:56.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可能是我多心了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.74,0:19:58.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正把他帶出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:19:59.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,盯著就好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.04,0:20:09.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們離開多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:11.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭說半月國不遠
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:12.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,應該快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:15.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我怕鄭伯撐不到他們回來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:16.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:18.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想解手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:19.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:20.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還有我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.55,0:20:25.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:36.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:03.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這就是半月國了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:05.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,牆是挺高
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.10,0:21:07.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但看起來還沒一座城大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:09.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打這國
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:10.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,豈不是只要幾天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:13.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可別小瞧這沙漠小國
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:15.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,雖說不過萬人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.23,0:21:16.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可全民皆兵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.31,0:21:17.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,勇猛好鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:18.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以特別難打
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:21.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道長知道得不少
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.53,0:21:23.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:23.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:25.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:35.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼一轉眼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.87,0:21:37.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那些人就不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.75,0:21:39.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,難道還要我一個一個找出來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:43.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是半月國師
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.01,0:21:45.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,叫你那些朋友幫你找
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.43,0:21:46.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:48.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就愛叫你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.01,0:21:49.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:52.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有什麼值得開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.85,0:21:53.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.69,0:21:55.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:56.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要先出手嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:21:58.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等她們離開吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.81,0:21:59.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,時間寶貴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.94,0:22:01.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,找善月草要緊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.78,0:22:02.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,現在交手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:05.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,萬一她把那群傳說中的半月士兵給叫來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:06.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.95,0:22:12.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:13.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
